 174:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   * @brief  Setup the microcontroller system
 175:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *         Initialize the FPU setting and  vector table location
 176:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *         configuration.
