 297:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c **** 
 298:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c **** /**
 299:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   * @brief  Update SystemCoreClock variable according to Clock Register Values.
 300:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *         The SystemCoreClock variable contains the core clock , it can
 301:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *         be used by the user application to setup the SysTick timer or configure
 302:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *         other parameters.
 303:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *
 304:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   * @note   Each time the core clock changes, this function must be called
 305:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *         to update SystemCoreClock variable value. Otherwise, any configuration
 306:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *         based on this variable will be incorrect.
 307:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *
 308:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   * @note   - The system frequency computed by this function is not the real
 309:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *           frequency in the chip. It is calculated based on the predefined
 310:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *           constant and the selected clock source:
 311:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *
 312:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *           - If SYSCLK source is CSI, SystemCoreClock will contain the CSI_VALUE(*)
 313:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *           - If SYSCLK source is HSI, SystemCoreClock will contain the HSI_VALUE(**)
 314:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *           - If SYSCLK source is HSE, SystemCoreClock will contain the HSE_VALUE(***)
 315:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *           - If SYSCLK source is PLL, SystemCoreClock will contain the CSI_VALUE(*),
 316:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *             HSI_VALUE(**) or HSE_VALUE(***) multiplied/divided by the PLL factors.
 317:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *
 318:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *         (*) CSI_VALUE is a constant defined in stm32h7xx_hal.h file (default value
 319:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *             4 MHz) but the real value may vary depending on the variations
 320:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *             in voltage and temperature.
 321:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *         (**) HSI_VALUE is a constant defined in stm32h7xx_hal.h file (default value
 322:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *             64 MHz) but the real value may vary depending on the variations
 323:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *             in voltage and temperature.
 324:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *
 325:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *         (***)HSE_VALUE is a constant defined in stm32h7xx_hal.h file (default value
 326:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *              25 MHz), user has to ensure that HSE_VALUE is same as the real
 327:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *              frequency of the crystal used. Otherwise, this function may
 328:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *              have wrong result.
 329:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *
 330:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *         - The result of this function could be not correct when using fractional
 331:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   *           value for HSE crystal.
 332:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   * @param  None
 333:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   * @retval None
 334:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   */
